    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1615">

                <pb facs="1354" n="1250" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1250"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.5048/51.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Consul at Iquitos.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department acknowledges the receipt of Mr. Fuller’s dispatch No. 3 of May 31,
                    1912, and instructs him to use care to pay for everything and to accept no
                    favors should he find that he can go on no launch other than the company’s.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
